From 9a1370aa8043ddd747788d2b7fee8034605ce8a3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Huacai Chen <chenhuacai@loongson.cn>
Date: Fri, 28 Aug 2026 11:11:57 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 099/344] FROMLIST: cpufreq: loongson3: Make this driver depend
 on MACH_LOONGSON64

32BIT Loongson machines don't have SMC and FreqCtrl registers, so make
this driver depend on MACH_LOONGSON64 (only for LoongArch based 64bit
machines currently).

Cc: stable@vger.kernel.org
Fixes: ccf51454145b ("cpufreq: Add Loongson-3 CPUFreq driver support")
Signed-off-by: Huacai Chen <chenhuacai@loongson.cn>
Reviewed-by: Zhongqiu Han <zhongqiu.han@oss.qualcomm.com>

Link: https://patch.msgid.link/20260828031201.1500767-2-chenhuacai@loongson.cn
Signed-off-by: Kexy Biscuit <kexybiscuit@aosc.io>
---
 drivers/cpufreq/Kconfig | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/drivers/cpufreq/Kconfig b/drivers/cpufreq/Kconfig
index db83f3365698c..edc1299098d47 100644
--- a/drivers/cpufreq/Kconfig
+++ b/drivers/cpufreq/Kconfig
@@ -288,6 +288,7 @@ endif
 if LOONGARCH
 config LOONGSON3_CPUFREQ
 	tristate "Loongson3 CPUFreq Driver"
+	depends on MACH_LOONGSON64
 	help
 	  This option adds a CPUFreq driver for Loongson processors which
 	  support software configurable cpu frequency.
-- 
2.56.0

